      </lg>
      <lg>
        <l><unclear>tavaḷat</unclear> tāmarai <lb/>tātā kōvil</l>
        <l>vaṉaip poṟṟu maruntami<unclear>ṭ</unclear> kuṟit<unclear>tē</unclear></l>
      </lg>
      <lg>
        <l>tantimukat tantaic cataṅ<unclear>kai</unclear>p patampōṟṟuñ</l>
        <l>cintai viḷakkān <lb/><sic>tī</sic>vākarattil vanta</l>
        <l>tokutiyoru paṉ<unclear>ṉireṇṭu</unclear>ñ cōṟāmal nērē</l>
        <l>pakutiyuṟai <unclear>maṉamē</unclear> paṟṟu</l>
      </lg>
      <lg>
        <l>āyakalaika ḷaṟupattiṉāṉ <lb/>kiṉaiyumē</l>
        <l>yavuṇarviyakku meṉṉam mēṟṟūya</l>
        <l>vuru<unclear>p</unclear>paḷiṅku pōlvāḷeṉeṉ ṉuḷḷat ti<unclear>ṉu</unclear>ḷḷē</l>
